WEBVTT

00:00:03.206 --> 00:00:07.333
Every register sale is a paid order, marked with its register.

00:00:07.333 --> 00:00:12.068
It appears in Commerce, Orders like any other order, with its lines, tax

00:00:12.068 --> 00:00:15.346
and payments, and the customer if there was one.

00:00:15.797 --> 00:00:19.609
A return at the till shows as a refund on the order, in

00:00:19.609 --> 00:00:23.109
the same shift, so the drawer and the books agree.

00:00:23.109 --> 00:00:29.047
Under Orders, a sale that was returned is marked Refunded, and its page shows the refund.

